<title>UK: J.D. Wetherspoon marked down after results.</title>
<headline>J.D. Wetherspoon marked down after results.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in J.D. Wetherspoon Plc were indicated lower on Tuesday after the company released its interim results.</p>
<p>At 0813 GMT, the shares were marked down 10p to 1143-1/2p in pre-market dealings.  </p>
<p>The group said its pre-tax profits rose 46 percent to 8.1 million stg in the six months ended January 31.</p>
<p>--London newsroom +44 171 542 5106</p>
</text>
